# Determinism: the figures and their CSV intermediate layer are byte-compared by
# verify.sh. `core.autocrlf` must not be allowed to rewrite them on checkout --
# that would make every build "fail" on a Windows clone for no reason.
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
SOURCES.sha256 text eol=lf
*.png   binary
# PDF (P10, the publication profile) is binary and must be declared so. Its
# streams contain byte sequences that look like CRLF, and an autocrlf checkout
# would rewrite them -- producing a corrupt PDF and a gate-6 diff with no defect
# in the pipeline to find. Exactly the failure `*.svg text eol=lf` above exists
# to prevent, in the opposite direction.
*.pdf   binary
